OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers this evening, these mainly
OL,7,Fover Shetland. Rain arrives into
OL,8,FOrkney by around midnight, moving
OL,9,Feastwards into Shetland late in the
OL,10,Fnight. Gale force southerly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA wet start with southerly
OL,13,Fgales but a drier and brighter
OL,14,Fafternoon across Orkney with some
OL,15,Fsunshine. Rain clearing Shetland early
OL,16,Fevening. Winds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
