OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith rain and strong winds at times on
OL,7,FSaturday. Bright spells and showers on
OL,8,FSunday. Further rain and strong winds
OL,9,Farriving from the west on Monday.
